SUMMARY:Amal Omrani - Explicit Computation of Super-Hedging Prices and Strategies under Transaction Costs
DESCRIPTION:In markets with transaction costs\, can super-hedging prices and strategies be explicitly characterized and computed directly from real market data\, without relying on dual formulations? This talk presents a constructive approach based on conditional supports and dynamic programming\, leading to explicit recursive formulas for super-hedging prices and strategies. The approach is illustrated using re\nhttps://indico.math.cnrs.fr/event/16984/
LOCATION:IHP - Bâtiment Borel
URL:https://indico.math.cnrs.fr/event/16984/
